			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"沐寧"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710740101,
					"content": "「老石」…唉，「老石」，我在層岩巨淵這麼多年都沒怎麼見到過，輝山廳的那些大人們啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740102,
					"content": "哪天他們要是自己來做做這種找東西的事，就知道有多辛苦了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740103,
					"content": "沐寧——！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740104,
					"content": "#哦，是{F#妳}{M#你}們啊，{F#妳}{M#你}們怎麼還在層岩巨淵上層逗留…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740105,
					"content": "#啊…當然，我沒有不歡迎{F#妳}{M#你}們的意思！我的意思是…呃，{F#妳}{M#你}們沒有別的要緊事去做嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740106,
					"content": "什麼呀，我們只是看你在頭疼所以才過來跟你打招呼的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740107,
						710740108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740107,
					"content": "發生什麼事了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710740109,
					"content": "#唉…{F#妳}{M#你}知道「老石」嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740110,
					"content": "那是一種即使在礦區也很少出現的稀有礦物，在層岩巨淵這麼多年我也只看過兩三枚，那可真是常人想像不到的瑰麗寶石啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740111,
					"content": "據說品相最好的那種，看起來內含毫光，顏色猶如日暮之時海天之分那一線那般…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740112,
					"content": "你說的是這種？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710740113,
					"content": "#…啊，這，{F#妳}{M#你}居然有，而且這是我見過的品相最完美的老石了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740114,
					"content": "#哎，我說{NICKNAME}啊，不如{F#妳}{M#你}把這枚「老石」賣給我吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740115,
						710740116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740115,
					"content": "絕無可能。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710740117,
					"content": "對，那可是一個朋友送給我們的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740118,
					"content": "而且，你哪來的錢夠買「老石」呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740119,
					"content": "畢竟是公家的事，錢倒不是問題…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740120,
					"content": "公家的事？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740121,
					"content": "是啊，是輝山廳的大人們，最近不知道為何，突然對「老石」產生了興趣，要求在層岩巨淵多找幾枚給他們進行一些研究。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740122,
					"content": "可是我每天應付…咳咳，處理公務就已經夠忙的了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740123,
					"content": "#不如這樣吧，{NICKNAME}，如果{F#妳}{M#你}找到了「老石」，就帶來給我，我把輝山廳的賞金給{F#妳}{M#你}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740124,
					"content": "#不過品相不用像{F#妳}{M#你}手上那麼好的，只要是「老石」就行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740125,
					"content": "輝山廳的賞金！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740126,
					"content": "#按理說我應該親自走一趟，但是層岩巨淵最近涉及到的事實在太多了，我有點分身乏術，只能拜託{F#妳}{M#你}們了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740127,
					"content": "唉，也不知道輝山廳的大人們要多少，不如就先拿三枚過來吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740128,
					"content": "好了好了，我們知道啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740116,
					"content": "想也別想。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710740108,
					"content": "有什麼為難的事嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740109
					]
				}
			]
		},
