					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740212,
					"content": "所以就是說，你現在需要一些「顏色很漂亮的石頭」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740213,
					"content": "也不是所有顏色很漂亮的石頭都行，是「那種」顏色很漂亮的石頭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740214,
					"content": "#不過…對了，不如{NICKNAME}{F#妳}{M#你}幫我留意一下，有沒有跟我描述很像的那種石頭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740215,
					"content": "如果帶過來的話，我願意出錢買下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
