				{
					"id": 710740223,
					"content": "#按理說我應該親自走一趟，但是層岩巨淵最近涉及到的事實在太多了，我有點分身乏術，只能拜託{F#妳}{M#你}們了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740224,
					"content": "唉，也不知道輝山廳的大人們要多少，不如就先拿三枚過來吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐寧"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740225,
					"content": "好了好了，我們知道啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740208,
					"content": "有什麼為難的事嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740209
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7107403,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
